[
  {
    "text": "China",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 703,
    "file": "4c4c0d4e0719.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Nee how, Kaylee!",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 1716,
    "file": "0d55348c5369.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Nee how means hello in China!",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 3044,
    "file": "8678912e2304.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Tap the glowing lantern!",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 1852,
    "file": "8ff07e7f765f.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Where should we go next, Kaylee?",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 2466,
    "file": "213d913bc9ff.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Tap the dragon parade!",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 1981,
    "file": "d940392ccbcf.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "This lantern opens soon!",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 2217,
    "file": "50bf08dd2409.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Light up the lanterns to start the parade!",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 3734,
    "file": "5f553b3a6e16.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "The dragon parade is coming soon!",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 2714,
    "file": "065368640c22.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Kaylee, you did it! You won the China Explorer trophy!",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 4994,
    "file": "d44b3ea99195.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Kaylee, China Explorer! From China.",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 3350,
    "file": "3f86eb62bc39.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Nong how, Kaylee!",
    "voice": "doudou",
    "sig": "98f57b3ad8",
    "ms": 1673,
    "file": "6a79c4d7425f.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Chef Fu needs our help!",
    "voice": "doudou",
    "sig": "98f57b3ad8",
    "ms": 2215,
    "file": "6ec75f10113d.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Tap the zig-zag bridge!",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 2216,
    "file": "03403455ba9e.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Zig-zag bridges keep bad luck away!",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 3488,
    "file": "160c810eb7ef.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Tap the dumpling house door!",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 2293,
    "file": "f6f2ac843234.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Aiyo! So many hungry customers, and no helper!",
    "voice": "cheffu",
    "sig": "bb2b623567",
    "ms": 4684,
    "file": "0b34297a00d6.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Just four dumplings, please.",
    "voice": "grandpa",
    "sig": "1476215005",
    "ms": 1854,
    "file": "c08e6356a669.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Push the dough three times!",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 3189,
    "file": "1423edce6097.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Ee!",
    "voice": "cheffu",
    "sig": "bb2b623567",
    "ms": 632,
    "file": "7fd4f82b85de.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Are!",
    "voice": "cheffu",
    "sig": "bb2b623567",
    "ms": 530,
    "file": "b8cef8f8ce68.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "San!",
    "voice": "cheffu",
    "sig": "bb2b623567",
    "ms": 641,
    "file": "0d1f8eddca3a.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Smooth and shiny! Ee, are, san means one, two, three!",
    "voice": "cheffu",
    "sig": "bb2b623567",
    "ms": 5614,
    "file": "36d308eb4b70.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Swipe the dough to make a long snake!",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 3051,
    "file": "3f8d17e962ea.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Tap to cut the snake into four pieces!",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 4047,
    "file": "518cdea5efe6.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "One!",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 506,
    "file": "87ed107b16cf.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Two!",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 561,
    "file": "e53b779eaf65.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Three!",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 680,
    "file": "b98340c9d88a.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Four!",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 692,
    "file": "6ce079912c83.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Five!",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 800,
    "file": "8580303dc1c5.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Six!",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 796,
    "file": "a38f93f70592.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Roll the rolling pin back and forth!",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 2788,
    "file": "742eeead58c9.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "A perfect round wrapper!",
    "voice": "cheffu",
    "sig": "bb2b623567",
    "ms": 1916,
    "file": "b2048b6d2f59.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Tap the bowl for one spoonful!",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 2753,
    "file": "0bd75d7cf80d.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Ho ho ho! Just one spoonful!",
    "voice": "cheffu",
    "sig": "bb2b623567",
    "ms": 3309,
    "file": "a3b138eea7e0.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Draw a circle around the dumpling to fold it!",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 2852,
    "file": "8c7f69fe4104.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Beautiful! Real chefs make eighteen folds!",
    "voice": "cheffu",
    "sig": "bb2b623567",
    "ms": 4348,
    "file": "1bdd3db934a1.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Watch my quick hands!",
    "voice": "cheffu",
    "sig": "bb2b623567",
    "ms": 2171,
    "file": "0b8f54ab8cc5.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Fold these dumplings too!",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 2187,
    "file": "66f396f0c0b4.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "One, two, three, four dumplings!",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 4412,
    "file": "a9412fed82e0.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Put each dumpling in the basket, on the cabbage leaf!",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 4317,
    "file": "5f1158c28101.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "The cabbage leaf keeps them from sticking!",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 3061,
    "file": "c39a0eb7e968.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Tap the lid to close the basket!",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 3042,
    "file": "53d69b6864a6.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Tap the knob to heat the water!",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 2446,
    "file": "eded7bedf3f5.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Hot water makes steam. Steam cooks dumplings!",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 5747,
    "file": "a6a53f197371.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Pop the steam puffs!",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 1760,
    "file": "a39dc86eac27.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Tap the lid to peek!",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 2272,
    "file": "fc5cc9a1035d.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Ta-da! Soup dumplings!",
    "voice": "cheffu",
    "sig": "bb2b623567",
    "ms": 2325,
    "file": "6211531fd143.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Carry the basket to Grandpa Turtle's table!",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 3621,
    "file": "7ed628477de7.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Hot soup inside! Nibble, sip, eat.",
    "voice": "grandpa",
    "sig": "1476215005",
    "ms": 3698,
    "file": "c40920711d65.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Tap the dumpling to take a little nibble!",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 3116,
    "file": "a609f1e5e9d9.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Tap again to sip the soup!",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 1847,
    "file": "f6783c0e4dcd.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Now eat it all up!",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 2241,
    "file": "cbc966babb93.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "How chir! Delicious!",
    "voice": "grandpa",
    "sig": "1476215005",
    "ms": 3022,
    "file": "c696f46dfd80.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Aiyo! The lunch rush!",
    "voice": "cheffu",
    "sig": "bb2b623567",
    "ms": 2175,
    "file": "28cc9c8fd669.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Two pink and two green, please!",
    "voice": "bunnies",
    "sig": "46c690960b",
    "ms": 2227,
    "file": "0cd7a0f7e404.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "I'll have two yellow, please, dear.",
    "voice": "goose",
    "sig": "bc225f7bca",
    "ms": 2763,
    "file": "f800085f17eb.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Tap the pink dough!",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 2018,
    "file": "5e817c59bd02.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Tap the green dough!",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 1820,
    "file": "5bb9b0d106d3.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "That one is not pink. Find the pink dough!",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 4346,
    "file": "e49a9f9e5730.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "That one is not green. Find the green dough!",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 4445,
    "file": "e589d1a88d49.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Cream!",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 1912,
    "file": "61198e421d27.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Pink!",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 607,
    "file": "bfbd67beaa08.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Green!",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 1164,
    "file": "83769a2a17b3.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Yellow!",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 824,
    "file": "5144235b8cef.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Now fill it and fold it!",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 2709,
    "file": "2c13f008fae8.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "I'll make Mrs. Goose's dumplings!",
    "voice": "cheffu",
    "sig": "bb2b623567",
    "ms": 2469,
    "file": "9247164e1ebb.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Stack the baskets on the wok!",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 2626,
    "file": "9cc15815843d.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Dumpling chefs stack their baskets up high!",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 3851,
    "file": "e765e9c4aba1.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Take the pink ribbon basket to the Bunny Twins!",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 4470,
    "file": "3187f45b7de9.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Take the yellow ribbon basket to Mrs. Goose!",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 2913,
    "file": "bcf1d2043d1d.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Not mine, dear!",
    "voice": "grandpa",
    "sig": "1476215005",
    "ms": 2380,
    "file": "b2b9d3bb3b2d.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Not mine, dear!",
    "voice": "goose",
    "sig": "bc225f7bca",
    "ms": 2147,
    "file": "0fb0e090a36b.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Not ours!",
    "voice": "bunnies",
    "sig": "46c690960b",
    "ms": 979,
    "file": "36077e457cb7.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Yay! Pink and green! Thank you!",
    "voice": "bunnies",
    "sig": "46c690960b",
    "ms": 2961,
    "file": "079c104825c7.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Splendid! Thank you, dear.",
    "voice": "goose",
    "sig": "bc225f7bca",
    "ms": 2420,
    "file": "35b1e52b92fc.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Tap the table two times to say thank you for the tea!",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 4740,
    "file": "e3feb330091b.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "In China, a tap tap on the table means thank you!",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 4583,
    "file": "1547c9104daa.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "More tea?",
    "voice": "doudou",
    "sig": "98f57b3ad8",
    "ms": 1093,
    "file": "621eb15ff744.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Ding ding! Someone is here!",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 2249,
    "file": "93f13ee61693.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Five dumplings, please!",
    "voice": "baobao",
    "sig": "84ccf586ba",
    "ms": 1802,
    "file": "1d225a92d2ca.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "No, six!",
    "voice": "baobao",
    "sig": "84ccf586ba",
    "ms": 1704,
    "file": "042fbfa7e343.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Tap the colors to make six dumplings!",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 2873,
    "file": "21e1aeeb4f59.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Uh oh! Tap the sneaky monkey!",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 2584,
    "file": "a698e22b9873.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Hee hee! Sorry!",
    "voice": "houhou",
    "sig": "52d59a76fc",
    "ms": 1604,
    "file": "f873442a16f6.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Six dumplings! Now steam them!",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 3450,
    "file": "d19fccc99b9b.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Take the basket to Bao Bao's table!",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 4117,
    "file": "3ac94be46a49.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Mmm! How chir! I love dumplings!",
    "voice": "baobao",
    "sig": "84ccf586ba",
    "ms": 3680,
    "file": "19105ce6b6f1.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Great cooking! Ready for the next customers?",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 3147,
    "file": "2c71c2ac467c.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Everyone is clapping for you!",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 2009,
    "file": "4f3edd0a4e8b.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Shyeh shyeh, Chef Kaylee! A chef hat for you!",
    "voice": "cheffu",
    "sig": "bb2b623567",
    "ms": 4518,
    "file": "12f2076e220b.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Achoo! Thank you, Kaylee!",
    "voice": "lulu",
    "sig": "a660f33aaa",
    "ms": 2229,
    "file": "f9c0b0af3722.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Take some dumplings to the New Year parade!",
    "voice": "doudou",
    "sig": "98f57b3ad8",
    "ms": 2398,
    "file": "aa317d87075a.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Har gow! Shrimp dumplings!",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 2751,
    "file": "7617f9f7ed73.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Char siu bao! A fluffy bun!",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 2826,
    "file": "a46e7f5c6e24.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "An egg tart! Sweet and yummy!",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 3445,
    "file": "98899c058fbb.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "A sesame ball! Crunchy and chewy!",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 3215,
    "file": "8bf6609e84c5.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Spring rolls! Crispy!",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 2091,
    "file": "d761e052f218.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Dim sum means lots of little dishes to share!",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 2906,
    "file": "f1403986562a.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Hee hee! Woof!",
    "voice": "doudou",
    "sig": "98f57b3ad8",
    "ms": 1597,
    "file": "9201113582b5.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Shanghai is the biggest city in China!",
    "voice": "doudou",
    "sig": "98f57b3ad8",
    "ms": 3200,
    "file": "90bb958a4254.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Ho ho ho!",
    "voice": "cheffu",
    "sig": "bb2b623567",
    "ms": 1030,
    "file": "5052662ea216.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Dumplings make everyone happy!",
    "voice": "cheffu",
    "sig": "bb2b623567",
    "ms": 3164,
    "file": "65e810adbc5d.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Slow and steady, like me.",
    "voice": "grandpa",
    "sig": "1476215005",
    "ms": 3488,
    "file": "da951394e258.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Hello, little chef.",
    "voice": "grandpa",
    "sig": "1476215005",
    "ms": 1799,
    "file": "089f3ef4f345.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Hee hee hee!",
    "voice": "bunnies",
    "sig": "46c690960b",
    "ms": 1322,
    "file": "3a50205f4688.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "We're twins!",
    "voice": "bunnies",
    "sig": "46c690960b",
    "ms": 1147,
    "file": "ab57fe737352.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Oh, how lovely.",
    "voice": "goose",
    "sig": "bc225f7bca",
    "ms": 1829,
    "file": "eca03c13ad03.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Honk! Pardon me.",
    "voice": "goose",
    "sig": "bc225f7bca",
    "ms": 1781,
    "file": "695dcd8af8a9.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "More dumplings, please!",
    "voice": "baobao",
    "sig": "84ccf586ba",
    "ms": 1250,
    "file": "abd91c8adec6.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Hee hee! I love you!",
    "voice": "baobao",
    "sig": "84ccf586ba",
    "ms": 1959,
    "file": "80699a0dbcc9.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Squishy!",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 1843,
    "file": "4f2d789b6723.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Hello, little dumpling!",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 2386,
    "file": "fd6402987a38.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "My tummy is rumbling!",
    "voice": "baobao",
    "sig": "84ccf586ba",
    "ms": 2533,
    "file": "445be09be208.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Pandas eat bamboo all day!",
    "voice": "baobao",
    "sig": "84ccf586ba",
    "ms": 2657,
    "file": "04937aca2f6d.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Swipe up! Grow it three tall!",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 4194,
    "file": "0705a67969c3.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Three tall! Wow!",
    "voice": "baobao",
    "sig": "84ccf586ba",
    "ms": 1664,
    "file": "5f06ab0b7830.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Three tall is enough!",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 1931,
    "file": "7f4da6d5481d.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Crunch crunch! Yum!",
    "voice": "baobao",
    "sig": "84ccf586ba",
    "ms": 1731,
    "file": "191f63e0ca65.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Mmm! More bamboo, please!",
    "voice": "baobao",
    "sig": "84ccf586ba",
    "ms": 2058,
    "file": "08baec795e3b.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Make this one taller than that one!",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 2647,
    "file": "e3e12f9a9ac3.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Grow the glowing bamboo!",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 1874,
    "file": "6a1093a7c4cf.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Same height! Grow one more!",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 2340,
    "file": "1ab886f59fd2.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Taller! And that one is shorter!",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 3015,
    "file": "2d67b6de3de5.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Which one is the tallest? Tap it!",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 3301,
    "file": "0de52a73ff46.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Look for the tallest one!",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 2503,
    "file": "ef6502d09853.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Too short! Find the tallest!",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 2262,
    "file": "b08ecbf9fe28.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "The tallest bamboo!",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 2070,
    "file": "76a7bb853049.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Which one is the shortest? Tap it!",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 2891,
    "file": "4bf8a5b36937.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Look for the short one!",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 1443,
    "file": "6c87aa5dbf65.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Too tall! Find the shortest!",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 3021,
    "file": "0480c704d103.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "The shortest bamboo!",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 2138,
    "file": "171093f3ee82.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Bao Bao climbs the tallest bamboo!",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 2570,
    "file": "984e921f68f4.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Up, up, up!",
    "voice": "baobao",
    "sig": "84ccf586ba",
    "ms": 1853,
    "file": "33d21230d12b.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Whoa! Wheeee!",
    "voice": "baobao",
    "sig": "84ccf586ba",
    "ms": 1965,
    "file": "fdacb7fc99c9.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Soft leaves! Hee hee!",
    "voice": "baobao",
    "sig": "84ccf586ba",
    "ms": 1833,
    "file": "cbfcfb97ff7a.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Yum! Best snack ever!",
    "voice": "baobao",
    "sig": "84ccf586ba",
    "ms": 2280,
    "file": "17b524e50241.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Hee hee hee!",
    "voice": "baobao",
    "sig": "84ccf586ba",
    "ms": 1362,
    "file": "7c997d8b591c.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Wheee!",
    "voice": "baobao",
    "sig": "84ccf586ba",
    "ms": 802,
    "file": "0e21a0ddc07e.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Oops! I knocked bricks off the Great Wall!",
    "voice": "houhou",
    "sig": "52d59a76fc",
    "ms": 3801,
    "file": "ad467c479c3e.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "The wall is so long! Slide it to see more!",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 4094,
    "file": "415c03771952.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Slide the wall, or tap the arrow!",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 3412,
    "file": "df8268d21400.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Hou Hou ran ahead! Follow him!",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 2926,
    "file": "5c03d58ccd71.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Red, gold, red, gold... what comes next?",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 4818,
    "file": "560396bda99b.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Red, gold, gold, red, gold... what comes next?",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 4473,
    "file": "50d6fff4bc38.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Red, gold, jade, red... what comes next?",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 5182,
    "file": "f503aeb45044.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "One more! What comes next?",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 2316,
    "file": "1ae00e850ae2.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Try the glowing brick!",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 2586,
    "file": "bc406767e06d.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Yay! Thank you, Kaylee!",
    "voice": "houhou",
    "sig": "52d59a76fc",
    "ms": 2193,
    "file": "ec32f8c4b8d6.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Hee hee! The wall is getting strong!",
    "voice": "houhou",
    "sig": "52d59a76fc",
    "ms": 2769,
    "file": "a81010576e12.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Hooray! The whole wall is fixed!",
    "voice": "houhou",
    "sig": "52d59a76fc",
    "ms": 3002,
    "file": "1752ca43c660.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Tap the tower to light the signal fire!",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 2560,
    "file": "74e959bd4c51.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Soldiers sent smoke signals tower to tower!",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 3592,
    "file": "adac23a30bf9.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "The message zoomed along the wall!",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 2570,
    "file": "576779e30d2e.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Hee hee!",
    "voice": "houhou",
    "sig": "52d59a76fc",
    "ms": 764,
    "file": "2bea6eb60ef7.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Tickles!",
    "voice": "houhou",
    "sig": "52d59a76fc",
    "ms": 798,
    "file": "cbb00a6fdd67.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Giant panda sticker! Panda babies are born as tiny as a stick of butter!",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 6863,
    "file": "6b0b70fcb6a2.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Golden monkey sticker! These monkeys have sky-blue faces!",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 4746,
    "file": "9be7acdcdc08.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Pekingese sticker! These puppies from China look like tiny lions!",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 4887,
    "file": "ba51859354f4.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "In China, people say nee how! It means hello!",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 4318,
    "file": "7f7d9ebcfa13.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Shanghai is the biggest city in China! It has a tower with pink balls!",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 5221,
    "file": "dfb03a2994f2.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Soup dumplings come from Shanghai. There is soup inside!",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 4966,
    "file": "607e6f250a8b.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Dim sum is lots of little dishes, shared with tea.",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 3685,
    "file": "d2a906190698.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Chinese New Year has lanterns, dragons and red envelopes!",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 4880,
    "file": "f4f9762254c8.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Giant pandas live in the bamboo mountains of China.",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 3502,
    "file": "d9d3a37e94c8.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "The Great Wall of China is super long!",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 3338,
    "file": "242baa84ca33.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "China is a huge country with snowy places and sunny beaches!",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 4933,
    "file": "26f8b0da4a3f.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "This is China! Tap a picture to learn more.",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 4636,
    "file": "2f690adda890.mp3"
  }
]
